From e53969af7bfbe0c79df1a7904f7adac387cf3323 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>
Date: Mon, 24 Aug 2026 13:10:26 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 07/23] fix(web): simplify seller and store copy for
 non-technical shop owners
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Replace marketplace jargon in the Chinese UI copy of SellerDashboard and
StoreManagementPanel with plain shopkeeper language: 供给/需求方/撮合
become 商品/买家/匹配, identity-configuration and supply-API errors tell
the owner to contact mall staff, attachment wording becomes 图片, delivery
modes are described concretely (快递发货, 到店或上门服务), and store
lifecycle texts describe what customers see instead of catalogs and
onboarding.
